## CWV

One site per ticket. One optimization tier at a time (LCP → fonts/CLS → JS → CSS → legacy WP). Revert if regression. No `*-v2` cache busting.

---

## Deploy lead only

Merge → `work/astro-sites` → host `astro-fleet-development` → SSH-signed commit → `sudo /usr/local/sbin/astro-fleet-release publish` → live verify → **RELEASED**.
